  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are an ally of the singer herself, and her song inspires greater confidence because of this.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Onmyōji level 12th, know the song of benzaiten petition</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The song of benzaiten petition now increases all morale bonuses granted to the subject by +1.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> The song of benzaiten petition increases the largest morale bonus granted to the subject by +1.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You may only have one friendship feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/friendship-feats#toc0\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
